能在对面装了监控盯着他，怕打草惊蛇，也怕你害怕。\n\n女主：你……你说的是真的？那你为什么不告诉我？\n\n男主：我怕你每天活在恐惧里，只想等抓住他，再给你一个安心的交代。\n\n旁白：警笛声越来越近，窗外的男人被迅速控制。林晚看着陈默掌心的薄茧，那是这些天偷偷守在监控前、来回奔波留下的痕迹，满心的戒备，瞬间变成了愧疚与后怕。原来最让人安心的守护，从来都藏在不被察觉的细节里。", "1.7B", "auto", "bf16", "Auto", 0.5, 0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.3, true, 4, 226432280536389, "randomize", 2048, 0.8, 20, 1, 1.05, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"name": "role_bank", "link": 95, "label": "role_bank", "type": "QWEN3_ROLE_BANK", "localized_name": "role_bank"}, {"widget": {"name": "script"}, "name": "script", "label": "script", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "script"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_choice"}, "name": "model_choice", "label": "model_choice", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_choice"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "precision"}, "name": "precision", "label": "precision", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "precision"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "pause_linebreak"}, "name": "pause_linebreak", "label": "pause_linebreak", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "pause_linebreak"}, {"widget": {"name": "period_pause"}, "name": "period_pause", "label": "period_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "period_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "comma_pause"}, "name": "comma_pause", "label": "comma_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "comma_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "question_pause"}, "name": "question_pause", "label": "question_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "question_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "hyphen_pause"}, "name": "hyphen_pause", "label": "hyphen_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "hyphen_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "merge_outputs"}, "name": "merge_outputs", "label": "merge_outputs", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "merge_outputs"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", 